<title>AUSTRALIA: TOP 20 AUSTRALIAN DIVIDEND YIELDS - AUGUST 11.</title>
<headline>TOP 20 AUSTRALIAN DIVIDEND YIELDS - AUGUST 11.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
